<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35643" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνθύ̄μ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thought, piece of reasoning, argument,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				292
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1199
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				9.10
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.110
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>meaning, sense,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέξις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				4.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in
			Aristotle's Logic, <i>enthymeme, rhetorical syllogism drawn from
				probable premises</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ εἰκότων ἢ
				σημείων</span>), opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδεικτικὸς
				συλλογισμός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>APr.</u>
				70a10
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1355a6
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. δεικτικά,
			ἐλεγκτικά,</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1396b24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>invention, device,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.5.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.4.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				3.5.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				13.13
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				295
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
